        "title_2": "Shine: Celebrate Every Step",
        "text_2": "Every workout.\nEvery moment of self-discovery.\nThese moments deserve to be celebrated.\nAs a special gift with your watch, you'll receive our 14K Gold Butterfly Bracelet—the confidence to shine.\nBecause every chapter of your journey matters.",
