        "text_3": "From morning workouts to weekend escapes.\nFrom busy days to quiet moments by the sea.\nWith IP68 water resistance and up to 7 days of battery life, FANY Luna adapts beautifully to every part of your lifestyle.\nBecause the best technology should feel as natural as living.",
